<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#101827">
  <title>TaskCash - Digital Store</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0b1220;
      color: #ffffff;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: #131e30;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #29364b;
    }

    header h2 {
      margin: 0;
      color: #55d6a2;
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 45px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 34px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #a9b5c8;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 15px auto;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #55d6a2;
      color: #082016;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .notice {
      margin: 20px;
      padding: 15px;
      border: 1px solid #725f31;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #2c271a;
      color: #f3dca1;
    }

    .products {
      padding: 20px;
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .products h2 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #131e30;
      border: 1px solid #29364b;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .icon {
      font-size: 42px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #55d6a2;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #a9b5c8;
    }

    .price {
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    .disabled-button {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      background: #29364b;
      color: #a9b5c8;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .how {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .how h2 {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .step {
      background: #131e30;
      border: 1px solid #29364b;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .step p {
      color: #a9b5c8;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px 15px;
      border-top: 1px solid #29364b;
      color: #a9b5c8;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h2>TaskCash</h2>
    <p>Your Digital Products Store</p>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Learn, Build and Grow</h1>

    <p>
      Discover ebooks, trading journals and practical
      guides to help you develop skills and build
      your digital business.
    </p>

    <a href="#products" class="button">
      Explore Products
    </a>
  </section>

  <div class="notice">
    <strong>Important:</strong>
    Payments are not connected yet.
    No real earnings or withdrawals are processed
    on this website at this stage.
  </div>

  <section class="products" id="products">

    <h2>Our Digital Products</h2>

    <div class="grid">

      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">📘</div>

        <h3>From Zero to Wealth</h3>

        <p>
          A beginner-friendly ebook about developing
          skills, creating digital products and
          building realistic income opportunities.
        </p>

        <div class="price">
          Price to be configured
        </div>

        <button class="disabled-button" disabled>
          Checkout Coming Soon
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">📈</div>

        <h3>SMC Trading Journal</h3>

        <p>
          Organize your trading setups, record entries,
          manage risk and review your trading decisions.
        </p>

        <div class="price">
          Price to be configured
        </div>

        <button class="disabled-button" disabled>
          Checkout Coming Soon
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">📚</div>

        <h3>Trading Guide</h3>

        <p>
          Educational trading resources for beginners
          who want to study market structure and
          develop a trading plan.
        </p>

        <div class="price">
          Coming Soon
        </div>

        <button class="disabled-button" disabled>
          Coming Soon
        </button>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="how">

    <h2>How TaskCash Works</h2>

    <div class="step">
      <strong>1. Sell Digital Products</strong>
      <p>
        List your ebooks, journals and downloadable guides.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <strong>2. Confirm Real Payments</strong>
      <p>
        A connected payment provider must verify each
        successful payment before an order is marked paid.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <strong>3. Track Genuine Earnings</strong>
      <p>
        Record actual sales, transaction fees, refunds
        and money available after settlement.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <strong>4. Prepare Withdrawals</strong>
      <p>
        M-Pesa and other payout methods can be connected
        after the required accounts and integrations
        are configured and tested.
      </p>
    </div>

  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>
      TaskCash Digital Store
    </p>

    <p>
      Real payments and withdrawals are not active yet.
      Trading involves financial risk, and profits
      are never guaranteed.
    </p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
